Which reminds me of a nice trick for getting rid of the Mines
shopkeepers to loot their wands, if you don't have a powerful pet (or
no pet at all, after the protection racket I dismiss them if I don't
have a magic whistle). Steal, teleport (with teleport control) to
another shop, and put on conflict. If you steal on all shops, it's
really funy watching all the shopkeepers and Kops killing each other.

